  ('sceptre-wand', 'The Mini Wand', 'toys', 'DEEP RUMBLE • POCKET MASSAGER', 15000, 'DEEP RUMBLE • POCKET MASSAGER', '/assets/product-wand.webp', 'Don’t let the compact silhouette fool you. The Mini Wand packs full-sized, bone-deep vibrations into a palm-sized frame with a 360° flexible silicone head. Perfect for pinpoint clitoral stimulation, all-over tension relief, or slipping into an overnight bag.', ARRAY['Material: Silky Medical Silicone & Textured Grip', 'Sound Level: < 30 dB (Subtle & Discreet)', 'Waterproof: Splashproof & Easy Clean', 'Battery: USB Fast Charging']::text[], '[{"name":"Black","price":15000,"priceStr":"₦15,000","img":"/assets/product-wand.webp"},{"name":"Pink","price":15000,"priceStr":"₦15,000","img":"/assets/mini-wand-colors.webp"},{"name":"Purple","price":15000,"priceStr":"₦15,000","img":"/assets/mini-wand-colors.webp"},{"name":"Green","price":15000,"priceStr":"₦15,000","img":"/assets/mini-wand-colors.webp"}]'::jsonb, true),
