  ('sucking-rabbit', 'The Sucking Rabbit', 'toys', 'AIR-PULSE SUCTION • DUAL STIM', 35000, 'AIR-PULSE SUCTION • DUAL STIM', '/assets/sucking-rabbit.webp', 'The legendary rabbit silhouette reimagined for absolute sensory overload. Combines fluttering air-pulse clitoral suction ears with a flexible, deeply ribbed shaft designed to reach and stimulate the G-spot. Independent dual motor controls let you tailor your vibration speed and suction intensity simultaneously.', ARRAY['Material: Silky Medical-Grade Liquid Silicone & Pearlescent Handle', 'Dual Stimulation: Air-Wave Clitoral Suction + G-Spot Shaft Vibration', 'Sound Level: < 35 dB (Discreet & Powerful)', 'Waterproof: IPX7 Waterproof (Fully Submersible in Bath/Shower)', 'Battery: Magnetic USB Fast Rechargeable']::text[], '[]'::jsonb, true),
