  ('creature-cock-ring', 'Creature Ergonomic Cock Ring', 'toys', 'STAMINA LOCK • NON-VIBRATING', 15000, 'STAMINA LOCK • NON-VIBRATING', '/assets/creature-cock-ring.webp', 'Engineered by S-HANDE for unmatched stamina control and extended endurance. Crafted from velvety, medical-grade liquid silicone with an ergonomic contoured spine and dual-retention loops. Locks firm blood flow, prolongs hardness, separates testicles comfortably, and provides an effortless hands-free grip without vibration distraction.', ARRAY['Brand & Model: S-HANDE Creature Ergonomic Cock Ring', 'Material: 100% Medical-Grade Liquid Silicone', 'Length: 142 mm (5.59 inches)', 'Dual Loops: 34 mm Base Ring & 47 mm Retention Loop', 'Function: Non-Vibrating Stamina Lock & Delay', 'Waterproof: 100% Waterproof & Submersible']::text[], '[]'::jsonb, true),
