  ('african-brute', 'African Brute Herbal Tincture', 'lubes', 'STAMINA', 27000, 'STAMINA', '/assets/african-brute.webp', 'An authentic African botanical elixir scientifically crafted with 8 potent natural aphrodisiac extracts including Corynanthe Yohimbe, Muira Puama, and Cola Acuminata. Formulated to enhance stamina, maximize blood flow to sensitive zones, revitalize libido, and intensify climax sensations.', ARRAY['Volume: 500ml Oral Liquid Tonic', 'Certification: NAFDAC Reg No. A7-5237L', 'Active Formula: 8 Traditional African Botanical Extracts', 'Directions: 5 Tablespoons (40ml) 30–40 mins before intimacy']::text[], '[]'::jsonb, true),
