  ('luxury-leather-cuffs', 'Sovereign Leather Cuffs', 'bdsm', 'LEATHER RESTRAINTS', 22000, 'LEATHER RESTRAINTS', '/assets/IMG_7072.webp', 'Handcrafted black vegan leather wrist restraints lined with plush fleece to protect delicate skin. Interconnected by a detachable, polished gold link chain and dual swivel snap-hooks.', ARRAY['Lining: Ultra-Soft Fleece Padding', 'Hardware: High-Tensile Polished Gold-Tone Steel', 'Adjustability: Universal Buckle Fit (Wrists & Ankles)']::text[], '[]'::jsonb, true),
